= Supported C\/C++ compilers <dynamic_link:2_supported_compilers>



== Description

#strong[Windows:];

 - Microsoft Visual Studio C\/C++ 2022 all versions (Pro, Enterprise or Community)

 - Microsoft Visual Studio C\/C++ 2019 all versions (Pro, Enterprise or Community)

 - Microsoft Visual Studio C\/C++ 2017 all versions (Pro, Enterprise or Community)

 - MinGW

 #strong[GNU\/Linux:];

 - GNU C\/C++ compilers packaged with all distributions.

 #strong[MacOS X:];

 - XCode C\/C++ compilers.

 If you use macOS, the CMake dmg must be installed from #link("https://cmake.org/download/")[https:\/\/cmake.org\/download\/];.

 XCode must be installed #strong[using the command:]; #raw("xcode-select --install");


